/* ev-pc-hs-hero-blur */

/* PC hero (#hs-hero): sharp image CENTRED at its real aspect ratio over a heavy blur of itself.
   Image edges are dissolved twice: (1) eased alpha fade on every edge, (2) a blur layer laid OVER the
   image edges (backdrop blur, strongest at the border) — so no border can be seen. Dark vignette on both sides. */
